"P3435821000" "Vahzilok data"
// DetailString :
"P4261083378" "This data contains information on the Vahzilok you defeated. It will be cross-referenced with previous scans to determine if these Vahzilok were carriers of the deadly new plague."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
