// Dialog :
"P1427019755" "So, Dr. Vahzilok's minions made off with some of the serum ! If Dr. Vahzilok modifies his virus to resist that drug, we may not be able to stop the epidemic!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3689934394" "Even with the sniffles, {HeroName} is still the bomb!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - StoryArc_Mission4.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1347308484" "Now that Dr. Vahzilok has a sample of the antidote, it's only a matter of time before he can modify his virus and undo our work. However, I've analyzed all the data, and I think I have a very viable candidate for the ground zero of this entire outbreak. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to go down to the sewers and incinerate every body you find.</A> If you can manage this, {HeroName}, you'll put an end to Vahzilok's evil plague forever!"
// AcceptString :
"P476514555" "Go to the sewers and incinerate every body you find"
// SendOffString :
"P3941811996" "You must be careful, {HeroName}. Dr. Vahzilok himself knows about your involvement, and may try to stop you. You'll have to judge for yourself if you'll be strong enough to fight him, or if destroying the bodies is the better answer. Maybe we can put an end to this whole thing here and now, before the rest of the city gets infected."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2219437671" "Put an end to Vahzilok plague"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3738795353" "Please put an end to this Vahzilok plague!"

